        "TileImage": "$($repository c9c6bfff-60af-4cdb-b84d-68b4cf990625).Image",
        "Description": "I don&apos;t know how to describe this 47, but apparently this man was called out for filming and taking pictures of bare feet from innocent people whenever he goes and sharing them on the Dark Web for money. This man is sick, and used his so-called talent as a means of getting work for film and TV, trying to force in his feet fascination whenever he goes. Why he likes bare feet I will never understand, but he makes me sick.",
